<title>USA: Pro-Dex COO Charles Strait resigns.</title>
<headline>Pro-Dex COO Charles Strait resigns.</headline>
<dateline>BOULDER, Colo 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pro-Dex Inc said Friday Charles Strait had resigned as president and chief operating officer of the company.</p>
<p>The company said Strait had also resigned from his post as president of its Micro Motors Inc subsidiary.</p>
<p>Strait was resigned for health reasons, it said, adding that the board of the holding company was looking for a successor.</p>
</text>
